# ABP Object Extensions

## IHasExtraProperties
Implemented by `AggregateRoot`, `ExtensibleEntityDto`, and related base classes.

## Setting/Getting Extra Properties
```csharp
user.SetProperty("Title", "My Title");
var title = user.GetProperty<string>("Title");
```

## Best Practice - Extension Methods
```csharp
public static class IdentityUserExtensions
{
    private const string TitlePropertyName = "Title";

    public static void SetTitle(this IdentityUser user, string title)
        => user.SetProperty(TitlePropertyName, title);

    public static string GetTitle(this IdentityUser user)
        => user.GetProperty<string>(TitlePropertyName);
}
```

## ObjectExtensionManager
Define extra properties explicitly for validation, mapping, and EF Core:

```csharp
ObjectExtensionManager.Instance
    .AddOrUpdateProperty<IdentityUser, string>(
        "SocialSecurityNumber",
        options =>
        {
            options.Attributes.Add(new RequiredAttribute());
            options.MapEfCore(b => b.HasMaxLength(32));
        });
```

## Object Mapping
Use `MapExtraPropertiesTo()` or AutoMapper's `MapExtraProperties()` extension.
